---
---
<section id="transformation" class="lux-section lux-section--feature">
  <div class="orb orb-b transform-orb"></div>
  <div class="container">

    <div class="transform-intro">
      <div class="section-label">Results</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Turn Content Into <em>Real Engagement</em></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="ba-scene" id="baScene">
      <div class="ba-glow-halo"></div>

      <div class="ba-labels" id="baLabels">
        <span class="ba-label-before">Jan 1 - Jan 31</span>
        <span class="ba-label-after">Feb 9 - Mar 10</span>
      </div>

      <div class="ba-slider" id="baSlider">
        <div class="ba-spotlight" id="baSpotlight"></div>

        <img
          src="/images/IG1.jpeg"
          alt="After - Feb 9 to Mar 10: 349,391 views, 35,070 accounts reached"
          class="ba-img ba-img-after"
          id="baImgAfter"
          width="1170"
          height="1580"
          draggable="false"
        />

        <img
          src="/images/IG2.jpeg"
          alt="Before - Jan 1 to Jan 31: 25,342 views, 597 accounts reached"
          class="ba-img ba-img-before"
          id="baImgBefore"
          width="1170"
          height="1580"
          draggable="false"
        />

        <div class="ba-divider" id="baDivider" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="ba-beam-particles"></div>
          <div class="ba-handle" id="baHandle">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M9 18l-6-6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              <path d="M15 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="ba-drag-overlay"
          id="baDragOverlay"
          role="slider"
          aria-label="Drag to compare before and after results"
          aria-valuenow="50"
          aria-valuemin="2"
          aria-valuemax="98"
          tabindex="0"
        ></div>
      </div>

      <p class="ba-hint-text" aria-hidden="true">&larr; drag to compare &rarr;</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ba-compare-bar" id="baCompareBar">
      <div class="ba-compare-col ba-col-before">
        <span class="ba-c-period">Jan 1 - Jan 31</span>
        <div class="ba-c-metrics">
          <div class="ba-c-metric">
            <span class="ba-c-val" data-count="25342" data-format="comma">25,342</span>
            <span class="ba-c-name">Views</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ba-c-sep"></div>
          <div class="ba-c-metric">
            <span class="ba-c-val" data-count="597">597</span>
            <span class="ba-c-name">Accounts Reached</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ba-live-panel" aria-live="polite">
        <span class="ba-live-kicker" id="baLiveKicker">Split reveal</span>
        <strong class="ba-growth-badge" id="baGrowthBadge">7.4x views lift</strong>
        <span class="ba-live-sub" id="baLiveSub">29.9x reach lift</span>
        <div class="ba-reveal-meter" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="ba-meter-fill"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="ba-meter-labels" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>Jan</span>
          <span>Feb-Mar</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ba-compare-col ba-col-after">
        <span class="ba-c-period">Feb 9 - Mar 10</span>
        <div class="ba-c-metrics">
          <div class="ba-c-metric">
            <span class="ba-c-val" data-count="349391" data-format="comma">349,391</span>
            <span class="ba-c-name">Views</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ba-c-sep"></div>
          <div class="ba-c-metric">
            <span class="ba-c-val" data-count="35070" data-format="comma">35,070</span>
            <span class="ba-c-name">Accounts Reached</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="transform-body">
      <p>Through strategic content and thoughtful digital positioning, a social media presence can evolve from limited interaction to a much <strong>stronger and more active audience.</strong></p>
      <p>My approach focuses on improving how brands communicate online. By combining engaging visual content, storytelling, and strategic targeting, content becomes more discoverable and meaningful.</p>
      <p>The result is a stronger connection with followers, greater visibility across platforms, and a digital presence that feels consistent and alive.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
